35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found it! Transport and crating ate a third of the installation budget. Plus, joiner rates jumped fifty percent. I need to know which candidates bring their own mounts.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. If an exhibition needs heavy conservation, we are stuck.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The data is clear. People return for presence and movement, not static cases. I will check the volunteer roster to see if we can staff that.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre. Last season, stonework required shoring. We cannot exceed that limit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the paperwork confirms it. Two openings slipped because distant lenders missed the shipping cut-offs. That is where we lose the season.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that is terrifying! If the paperwork slips, the transport costs I found become a nightmare. I am so glad we checked that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, presence and movement require staff. With the lab at one person, who actually stands in the room to manage the flow?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the roster is thin, but the data is undeniable. We must prioritize engagement over static display.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Victoria, the evening hires are the real constraint. Six nights a season, the space is already spoken for. We cannot promise an open arrangement that cannot be shut up.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, the maintenance log shows four call-outs during opening hours. If the lab is short-staffed, those quiet failures will linger and frustrate visitors.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, six nights gone means we lose revenue. I need to know if the candidates fit the weight limit to avoid extra shoring costs!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, those call-outs are the symptom. The root is that one person cannot cover the floor and the lab. We need a candidate that minimizes intervention.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, the head counts confirm it. Static cases lose the crowd. We need a candidate that moves, not just sits.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the weight limit is absolute. If a candidate exceeds four hundred kilos per square metre, we need shoring. That is a hard cost and a schedule risk.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, movement is lovely, but if the powered elements fail, the silence is deafening. We must choose reliability over spectacle.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning toward candidates that bring their own mounts. It saves the joiner's fees and keeps the budget safe. Who else agrees?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am leaning toward candidates that minimize conservation needs. With one person in the lab, we cannot afford heavy intervention.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I am not finished. The data points to engagement, but I need to know if the volunteers can actually deliver it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning toward candidates that are self-contained and shut up securely. The evening hires mean we cannot leave things exposed or fragile.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning toward candidates with local lenders. Distant paperwork is where the season quietly slips away.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
